*** Test Cases ***
CB008761-ET-L007_Activation of data collection and training for CA Scell activation with 6CC TTTFFF use case when BTS is start-up
    [Documentation]
    ...    1. This user scenario describes activation of CB008761 feature. After TDD cell setup,
    ...    the mlTrainingState set to Training.
    ...    3. Test Case Steps:
    ...           a. site all cell setup, lock all TDD cell, check mlTrainingState state
    ...           b. unlock all TDD cell, check mlTrainingState state
    ...           c. setup some 6CC UE to nrcell-2
    ...           d. setup some other CC UE base attach to the same NRCELL-2
    ...           e. check counter
    ...    4. Expected Results:
    ...           a. mlTrainingState state set to idle
    ...           b. mlTrainingState state set to Training
    ...           c. 6CC UE setpup ok
    ...           d. some other CC UE setup ok
    ...           e. counter is as expected
    [Tags]    QC_113738    L007    CA_LABEL-3T3F(2_100M_TDD_n78+60M_TDD_n41+1_20M_FDD_n66+1_10M_FDD_n66+10M_FDD_n71)
    Lock all TDD cell
    Get mlstate    expect_state=Idle
    Unlock all TDD cell
    Get mlstate    expect_state=Training
    Clear Counter Files
    Setup 6CC UEs
    Setup other CC UE
    Show each UE traffic pdsch
    Release ues    ue_type=all
    Check Counters    ${PM_Counters_Check_L007}
    Get mlstate    expect_state=Training

*** Keywords ***
Lock all TDD cell
    lock NRCell1
    lock NRCell2
    lock NRCell3

Unlock all TDD cell
    Unlock NRCell1
    Unlock NRCell2
    Unlock NRCell3
    Cells Should Be Onair    check_sib=${True}    timeout=600

Get mlstate
    [Arguments]    ${expect_state}=Training    ${expect_inference}=unavailable
    ${mlTrainingState}    Get Scf Parameter Value    NRDU-1:mlScellActParamSet1:mlTrainingState
    log    ${mlTrainingState}
    Should Be Equal    ${mlTrainingState}    ${expect_state}
    ${mlinferencestate}    Get Scf Parameter Value    NRCELL-1:mlScellActParamSet2:mlInferenceState
